WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.400
Both rules give the same c, so set them equal.

2
00:00:04.201 --> 00:00:07.376
At the crossing, both rules give the same cost.

3
00:00:07.979 --> 00:00:11.054
Put the Lite rule in place of c in the Big rule.

4
00:00:11.932 --> 00:00:15.582
That gives g equals six, and c equals thirty six.
